; =============================================================================
;  MITSUBISHI-STYLE LPG FORKLIFT
;  -- Chassis box kept (same physics + wheel positions) but visually re-skinned
;     in cream/grey + orange Mitsubishi livery.
;  -- Adds: counterweight extension w/ horizontal LPG cylinder at rear, hood
;     panel up front, full cab interior (seat, steering wheel on column,
;     dashboard, control levers), four-post ROPS overhead guard with roof bars.
;  -- Three Node3D ToolSlot anchors inside the cab for stowing scissors / scanner
;     (right of steering wheel on dash, behind seat on counterweight, left footwell).
;  -- BaleClamp.tscn mirrors this entire chassis — only the tool hanging off the
;     mast carriage differs (forks here, plates there).
; =============================================================================

